error[K0041]: cannot enter @strict block - value has active aliases
  --> tests\ui\strict_k0042_closure_capture.kobo:5:9
  |
3 |     let _shared = data.clone();
  |                   ------------ alias created here
5 |         let f = || data.borrow_mut().push(4);
  |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ active aliases at @strict block entry
  |
why: value has 1 active alias when the @strict block starts; all aliases must end before the boundary is entered
fix: drop or explicitly clone-then-drop aliases before the @strict { } boundary
error[K0042]: closure captures value across @strict boundary
  --> tests\ui\strict_k0042_closure_capture.kobo:5:27
  |
5 |         let f = || data.borrow_mut().push(4);
  |         ------------------------------------- @strict block here
5 |         let f = || data.borrow_mut().push(4);
  |                           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ closure captures a shared mutable binding across @strict boundary
  |
why: a closure defined inside an @strict block captures a shared mutable binding; calling the closure later could keep strict boundary guards alive for too long
fix: extract the closure outside the @strict block, or refactor to avoid capturing the guarded value
